    "enTitle": "ZZZZ111 - Validation of the DEFI_CABLE_BP operator",
    "enLead": "v1.01.111 ZZZZ111 - Validation of the DEFI_CABLE_BP operator Summary: The purpose of this test case is to validate the DEFI_CABLE_BP operator, which calculates the voltage profiles in prestressing cables of a concrete structure, in accordance with BPEL rules: these allow for the loss of tension by contact between cables and concrete, by recoiling at anchors, by removing and creeping concrete and by relaxing steel, th",
