    "enLead": "v1.01.352 ZZZZ352 – Keyword validation SOLVEUR / ELIM_LAGR = 'OUI' Summary This test validates the keyword SOLVEUR / ELIM_LAGR = 'OUI' which allows the equations corresponding to the dualised linear relationships to be removed in a matrix, which sometimes makes the matrix defined positive. There are four modellings (A,B,C,D). 1 Test principle The problem is some very simple mechanical elastic problem. The kinematic b",
