    "enTitle": "ZZZZ356 - Validation of the RAFF_GP command",
    "enLead": "v1.01.356 ZZZZ356 - Validation of the RAFF_GP command Summary This validation test allows you to present a refinement of mesh obtained from the RAFF_GP command. The starting point is a coarse mesh of a cut-out structure. The finish is a mesh of the same cut-out structure, mesh refined in the calculation area of the mechanical parameter of breakage. This documentation is deliberately succinct. 1 Reference problem Figu",
