    "enTitle": "ZZZZ359 – Validation of POST_CZM_FISS / OPTION macro-command = 'TRIAXIALITE'",
    "enLead": "v1.01.359 ZZZZ359 – Validation of POST_CZM_FISS / OPTION macro-command = 'TRIAXIALITE' Summary This test validates the functionality available under keyword OPTION = 'TRIAXIALITE' of POST_CZM_FISS [U4.86.02](doc:u4.86.02) Macro Command. In this case, the macro command provides a sized card with mesh cells number bearing cohesive elements (joint or interface), containing the value of the average triaxiality rate in th",
