    "enLead": "­-­ 1 v6.03.123 SSNP123 - Elastoplasticity plate Summary: This quasi-static plane deformation test illustrates the questions of incompressibility when using an elastoplastic constitutive law: when the plasticity rate becomes significant, non-physical stress oscillations may occur. It is shown that the use of elements QUAD4 and HEXA8 under integrated can help to overcome this problem. It is a rectangular plate, which",
