    "enLead": "v6.04.171 SSNV171 – Intercomparison of behaviors MONOCRISTAL AND POLYCRISTAL Summary: The purpose of this test is to validate MONOCRISTAL and POLYCRISTAL behaviors by intercomparison, in a particular situation: one single grain for MONOCRISTAL and one single phase for POLYCRISTAL. The crystalline behavior is of the type MONO_VISC1, MONO_CINE1, MONO_ISOT1 (Meric-Cailletaud). The geometry processed is a material point,",
