    "enLead": "v6.04.176 SSNV176 – Law Identification ENDO_ORTH_BETON Summary: The ENDO_ORTH_BETON law tests are presented here on a single element to identify the model parameters. Since there is no empirical formula for calibrating the parameters, the user can use some of the test cases presented here to adjust his parameters. The study of the model parameters is in the [R7.01.09](doc:r7.01.09) documentation. The 5 tests proposed",
