    "enLead": "v7.14.303 HSLV303 – CALC_THERMECA_MULT operator verification on a hollow cylinder subjected to thermal shock Summary: To reduce the time required to set up thermomechanic calculations in the linear domain, a new methodology is proposed. This methodology consists of determining the temperature in a structure from the calculation of a unit thermal shock using the CALC_THERMECA_MULT macro-command. The objective of this",
