    "enLead": "v8.21.100 ADLV100 - Piston coupled to a fluid column Summary: Calculation of the first mode acoustic fluid-structure coupling of a fluid system1 - fluid piston 2. The stiffness and mass matrices of the fluid and fluid-structure coupling elements are tested. The free surface boundary condition is also tested. 1 Reference problem 1.1 Geometry , , constant square section, or circular section (in the case axisymmetric) c",
