    "enTitle": "ADLS102 - Meridian fluid-elastic oscillator",
    "enLead": "v8.21.102 ADLS102 - Meridian fluid-elastic oscillator Summary: The objective is to calculate the displacement of the piston of a \"merid fluid-elastic oscillator\". It is a spring plunger coupled with a fluid contained in a rigid and fixed wall channel; the channel is crossed by a depressurization wave. The plan problem of this meridian model is considered. This two-dimensional problem is reduced to a one-dimensional p",
