    "enTitle": "AHLV303 - linear elasticity hollow sphere immersed in infinite fluid",
    "enLead": "v8.22.303 AHLV303 - linear elasticity hollow sphere immersed in infinite fluid Summary: The objective of this test is to validate the IFS formulations with consideration of the Sommerfeld condition. This is an test case solution which is (semi) analytical 1 Reference problem 1.1 Geometry A hollow sphere of external radius and internal radius immersed in water is considered to be infinite. But for the modelling of the",
